gi delle Catene","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"For his services in saving the princess, Haku is invited to the palace and given an audience with the emperor. He is gifted two girls who are called the Priestesses of Chains. But he doesn't realize the deep meaning they possess.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-12-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pAWVe7yl7dL7A5MEfKstySMPV02.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pAWVe7yl7dL7A5MEfKstySMPV02.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/46412/season/2/episode/12"},{"id":"3840641","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Gli Otto Pilastri","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yamato is threatened by a barbarian invasion from the north, but the town doesn't seem worried at all. The eight pillar generals mount a counterattack, and Haku finds himself dragged along.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-01-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y4AhJC08vkLNma1yCDOTb68KZ1y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y4AhJC08vkLNma1yCDOTb68KZ1y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/46412/season/2/episode/13"},{"id":"3840642","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Il maestro della spada","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The invading forces are taking Yamato citizens hostage and using them as front line troops against the Eight Pillar generals. Rurutie and Haku go on a dangerous mission behind enemy lines to release the hostages' loved ones.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-01-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nPNg5nTCMzbW80lUjFVYm07g5sJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPNg5nTCMzbW80lUjFVYm07g5sJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/46412/season/2/episode/14"},{"id":"3840643","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Maschere","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The ancient power of the masks is brought down to bear on the invading Usuurussha armies. The armies are torn apart by the power of the Eight Pillar Generals, but is the cost to Yamato's own citizens too great?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-01-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zm9Ndee4oQOYng4jfBjuaO2M1Wl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zm9Ndee4oQOYng4jfBjuaO2M1Wl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/46412/season/2/episode/15"},{"id":"3840644","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Banchetto","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After returning from the war, Haku is deeply depressed. The girls all offer him gifts to cheer him up, but it doesn't help. So all the men decide to have a massive banquet and drink together. It gets out of hand and everyone starts taking off their clothes..","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-01-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kRpKvbUcRHn65TWKWnCDAQdVoSJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kRpKvbUcRHn65TWKWnCDAQdVoSJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/46412/season/2/episode/16"},{"id":"3840645","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Ultimi bagliori","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The truth behind Haku's past is revealed. What is his connection to the emperor, and to the mysterious and powerful masks?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-01-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oLLGUumPCsvmAYPlbrnkpjzDaYH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/ori